{"step_index":68,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T23:49:05Z","content":"Here are the ideas you probably didn't know about, ranked from most useful to least:\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Idea 1: \"Credit Stacking\" — Use 5 Free Sites Daily\nInstead of one platform, rotate across multiple free-tier sites every day:\n\n| Site | Free Daily Videos | Quality |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Hailuo AI](https://hailuoai.video) | ~5-10 clips/day | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent |\n| [Kling AI](https://klingai.com) | ~5 clips/day | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent |\n| [PixVerse](https://pixverse.ai) | ~5-10 clips/day | ⭐⭐⭐½ Good |\n| [Luma Dream Machine](https://lumalabs.ai) | ~5 clips/day | ⭐⭐⭐⭐ Great |\n| [Haiper](https://haiper.ai) | ~10 clips/day | ⭐⭐⭐ Decent |\n\n**Total: ~30-40 free clips per day by rotating platforms.** Most creators don't realize you can do this.\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Idea 2: Serverless GPU APIs (Pay Per Video, Not Per Hour)\nYou don't need to rent a whole GPU machine. These platforms let you just send a prompt and get a video back — you pay only for what you use:\n\n| Platform | How It Works | Cost Per Video (~8s) | Free Credits? |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [**fal.ai**](https://fal.ai) | API call → get video | ~₹2-5 per clip | ✅ Yes, starter credits |\n| [**Replicate**](https://replicate.com) | API call → get video | ~₹3-8 per clip | ✅ Yes, free trial |\n\n**Why this is huge:** No GPU setup, no VM management, no ComfyUI installation. You just call an API and get an `.mp4` back. At ₹2-5 per video, your \\$300 credit (if routed through Google Cloud billing) could generate **thousands** of videos.\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Idea 3: Cheap Indian GPU Providers (Cheaper Than Google Cloud)\nYou didn't know this — there are **Indian companies** renting GPUs with INR billing and GST invoices:\n\n| Provider | GPU | Price/Hour | vs Google Cloud |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [**JarvisLabs**](https://jarvislabs.ai) | RTX 4090 / A100 | ~₹30-80/hr | **50% cheaper** |\n| [**E2E Networks**](https://e2enetworks.com) | A100 / H100 | ~₹49/hr | **40% cheaper** |\n| [**Vast.ai**](https://vast.ai) | RTX 4090 | ~₹15-25/hr | **70% cheaper** |\n\nPay in INR, no international transaction hassles, no UPI errors.\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Idea 4: ComfyUI Cloud (Zero Setup)\nYou don't need to install anything. These services run ComfyUI in the cloud with open-source models pre-loaded:\n\n- [**ThinkDiffusion**](https://thinkdiffusion.com) — Cloud ComfyUI, pre-installed video models\n- [**RunComfy**](https://runcomfy.com) — Same concept, cheaper\n\nJust open the browser, drag-drop a workflow, type prompt, get video. No terminal, no Python, no GPU.\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Idea 5: Batch Processing with Multiple Free Accounts\nMany creators use multiple Google/email accounts to multiply their free quotas:\n- 3 Colab accounts = 3 parallel video generations\n- 3 Kaggle accounts = 90 GPU hours/week instead of 30\n- 3 Hailuo accounts = 15-30 free clips/day instead of 5-10\n\n*(This is technically against TOS for some platforms, but widely practiced)*\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Idea 6: WaveSpeed / Krea — Multi-Model Aggregators\nThese sites let you test **Sora, Veo, Kling, Wan** all from one interface:\n- [**WaveSpeed.ai**](https://wavespeed.ai) — Compare multiple models side by side\n- [**Krea.ai**](https://krea.ai) — Real-time generation + multiple model access\n\nGreat for finding which model gives the best result for YOUR specific prompt before wasting credits elsewhere.\n\n---\n\n### 🏆 What I'd Do If I Were You\n\n```\nStep 1: Sign up for Hailuo + Kling + PixVerse + Luma (30-40 free clips/day)\nStep 2: Use fal.ai free credits for API-based bulk generation\nStep 3: Take the $300 Google Cloud trial → rent a T4 VM → run Wan 2.1 in bulk\nStep 4: Process everything through FFmpeg + Remotion\n```\n\n**This gives you hundreds of free videos per week without spending a single rupee.**"}
